---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`Privacy Policy | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="Privacy Policy for Jack Maguire's website." />
		<meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<section class="page-lede">
				<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
				<p>
					Effective Date: August 7, 2026
				</p>
			</section>
			<div class="prose">
				<p>
					This Privacy Policy explains how Jack Maguire ("I", "me", or "my") collects, uses, and protects information when you use this website, submit a form, or purchase a service.
				</p>

				<h2>1. Information Collection</h2>
				<p>
					I collect information that you voluntarily provide, which may include your name, email address, business information, workflow descriptions, form responses, and purchase details. The compatibility quiz records the ranked answers, calculated scores, quiz version, submission time, page/referrer information, optional campaign parameters, and any optional name, contact, or note provided with the quiz. Results above 80 may display a separate follow-up form where a visitor can provide a phone number or Instagram handle if they want me to contact them about the result. The quiz does not require an email address or name. Payment card information is entered directly into Stripe and is not stored on this website.
				</p>

				<h2>2. Use of Information</h2>
				<p>
					I use this information to process purchases, provide the service you requested, communicate with you, issue refunds when applicable, improve the website, and measure advertising performance. I do not sell or rent your personal information.
				</p>

				<h2>3. Service Providers</h2>
				<p>
					Stripe processes payments and checkout information. Web3Forms processes website and assessment form submissions. Vercel hosts this website. Google Analytics and Meta business tools may process website activity and conversion events. These providers process information under their own terms and privacy policies.
				</p>

				<h2>4. Data Security</h2>
				<p>
					I take reasonable precautions to protect your personal information from unauthorized access, alteration, or disclosure.
				</p>

				<h2>5. Sensitive Information</h2>
				<p>
					Do not submit passwords, API keys, private customer records, health information, financial account details, or other sensitive personal information through an assessment form.
				</p>

				<h2>6. Your Choices</h2>
				<p>
					You may request access to or deletion of personal information you provided. Contact me using the address below. Some transaction records may need to be retained for accounting, fraud prevention, dispute handling, or legal obligations.
				</p>

				<h2>7. Contact</h2>
				<p>
					If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, please contact me at:
					maguirebaseball [at] gmail [dot] com
				</p>
			</div>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	.prose {
		max-width: var(--width-prose);
	}
	.page-lede {
		max-width: var(--width-prose);
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		padding-bottom: 1.35rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(85, 107, 47, 0.22);
	}
	.page-lede p:last-child {
		margin: 0;
		max-width: var(--width-prose);
		color: rgb(var(--gray-dark));
		font-size: 1.05em;
	}
	.prose h2 {
		font-size: 1.2em;
		margin-top: 2em;
		margin-bottom: 0.5em;
	}
</style>
